#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:2
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "ズーム"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:4
msgid ""
"Virtual zoom is described with a single dimensionless value of type integer."
" Similar to the interfaces described above, virtual zoom can be managed with"
" these methods:"
msgstr ""
"バーチャルズームは、整数型の次元のない単一の値で表されます。上記で説明したインターフェースと同様に、バーチャルズームはこれらのメソッドで管理できます："

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:8
msgid "setZoom(int zoom)"
msgstr "setZoom(int ズーム)"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:9
msgid "getZoom()"
msgstr "getZoom()"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:10
msgid "getMinZoom()"
msgstr "getMinZoom()"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:11
msgid "getMaxZoom()"
msgstr "getMaxZoom()"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Logitech C920 allows zoom values ranging from 100 to 500, although "
"values higher than 250-280 have no further effect on the preview image "
"(influenced by Vuforia)."
msgstr ""
"Logitech "
"C920は、ズーム値を100から500の範囲で設定できますが、250-280を超える値はプレビュー画像（Vuforiaの影響を受ける）に対してさらに効果がありません。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/ptz/zoom/zoom.rst:17
msgid ""
"These zoom methods are called on a PtzControl object, as described above for"
" exposure."
msgstr "これらのズームメソッドは、上記の露出に関して説明したように、PtzControlオブジェクトで呼び出されます。"
